OL,3,GNEWSAFamily allowance could be reviewed
OL,4,Aunder plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn allowance given to families and
OL,7,Ftheir eligibility for other benefits
OL,8,Fcould be reviewed as a Guernsey
OL,9,Fcommittee looks for savings.
OL,11,FFamily allowance is a #17.70 weekly,
OL,12,Ftax-free benefit for families bringing
OL,13,Fup children, provided their gross
OL,14,Fhousehold income is below #125,000 a
OL,15,Fyear.
OL,17,FIn its three-year work plan, the
OL,18,FEmployment and Social Security
OL,19,FCommittee said changes to family
OL,20,Fallowance could free up money to
OL,21,Freinvest in services and support for
OL,22,Fchildren and families.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
